  "_doc": "Pedestrians (js/npc.js logic, js/npcfig.js drawing). Add a kind of person = add an entry to 'archetypes'; no code change. Colour values: '#rrggbb', '@palette' (a random entry of palettes.palette), '=role' (copy another role), or a list of those (one is picked). Roles: skin hair top sleeve forearm hand thigh shin shoe acc pack tie bag fur2 (straw of the hat). 'opt': chance of each optional part (cap helmet long pack skirt tie bag hat = salakot / buri hat, umb = payong carried in any weather, coat = kapote); in the rain npc.js hands out a payong or kapote by itself (rain: chances, colours from palettes.rain); parts listed in 'excl' groups never come together. 'acts': weights of the things they stop to do (idle phone chat squat stretch sweep look wave sit). 'pet': 'dog' walks a dog on a leash. 'hail': chance this person is waiting for a ride (only if fewer than ride.maxHail are). h / wd: height / width scale range, speed: walking speed range (m/s), night: how many are out at night vs by day.",
